abstract: "A Python library for programmatic styling of phylogenetic trees for FigTree visualization. FigTreeKit provides a clean API to generate publication-ready Nexus files with full FigTree annotation support, including branch coloring, clade highlighting, custom fonts, and all layout options. It also supports taxonomy-aware clade auditing and phylogenetic tree rendering."
keywords:
  - phylogenetics
  - tree visualization
  - newick
  - nexus
  - figtree
  - bioinformatics
  - phylogenetic tree styling
  - evolutionary biology
  - BEAST
  - reproducible research
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
